<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Turn Undead</h1>
<p>Skill
Class: Healer (guild level 2), Paladin and Knight (guild level 5, up to 70%)
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>turn &lt;undead&gt;
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>turn zombie
</pre>
<p>Afraid of the undead? Hold up your faith against them: if you succeed, 
the undead creature is terrified and flees from you. It works even in the 
middle of a fight, a quick way to rid yourself of a ghoul that is too 
much for you.
</p><p>Your divine power and your skill decide it, against the undead's own. If 
it fails, or if what you try to turn isn't undead at all, it ignores you 
and attacks you. A successful turn costs 20 endurance; if you haven't got 
that much left, you collapse, stunned, and the undead is not turned.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
